    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classA" kindref="compound">A</ref> base class for implementing derived boundary conditions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class holds the information where a given boundary starts and ends in the consecutive boundaryVectors class</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>ValueType</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The data type of the field. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>the class template parameters is currently needed since the correctBoundaryConditions functions which takes templated arguments is virtual. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
